# local planning scaffold — not tracked
# (README.md is the tracked public project README; IMPLEMENTATION.md is the
# local implementation plan and stays untracked.)
.DS_Store
/API-CONTRACT.md
/TASKS.md
/issues.json
/bootstrap-github-project.sh
/IMPLEMENTATION.md
/SETUP.md
/task.md
.claude
/docs
CLAUDE.md
/ui
# Go
/kestrel
/bin/
*.test
*.out
# Vite env files are config, not secrets, and CI needs them — the *.test rule
# above (Go test binaries) would otherwise swallow web/.env.test.
!web/.env.test
# The built SPA is generated, not committed, but `//go:embed all:dist` in
# web/embed.go needs web/dist to exist at build time (the backend CI job runs
# `go build ./...` without building the frontend). Ignore the build output but
# keep a tracked placeholder so the embed pattern always matches.
/web/dist/*
!/web/dist/.gitkeep
